sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Tranche
    participant NAV as NAV Workflow
    participant Vault as IssuanceVault
    participant FIN as Finalization Workflow
    participant Finalizer

    User->>Tranche: Request delayed withdrawal
    Tranche->>Tranche: Store request for target epoch
    Note over NAV,Vault: Independent NAV workflow run
    NAV->>Vault: Apply NAV and advance epoch
    Vault->>Vault: currentEpochId increases
    Note over Vault,FIN: Later, on a separate cron run
    FIN->>Vault: currentEpochId()
    Vault-->>FIN: Updated epoch ID
    FIN->>Finalizer: checkUpkeep(0x)
    Finalizer-->>FIN: Previous epoch is ready
    FIN->>Finalizer: performUpkeep(0x) through CRE
    Finalizer->>Tranche: finalizeEpoch(targetEpoch)
    User->>Tranche: Claim withdrawal
    Tranche-->>User: Transfer withdrawable MZUSD
